sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant UI as React terminal
    participant Main as Electron main process
    participant API as Express API
    participant Auth as Device middleware
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Operator->>UI: Select authenticate terminal
    UI->>Main: Request device GUID and public key
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/device-challenge {device_guid}
    API->>DB: Verify active provisioned device
    API->>DB: Insert one-use nonce with 60-second expiry
    API-->>UI: {challengeId, challenge}
    UI->>Main: Sign challenge
    Main-->>UI: Ed25519 signature
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/device-login {device_guid, challenge_id, signature}
    API->>DB: Atomically consume challenge
    API->>API: Verify signature; issue 5-minute JWT
    API-->>UI: {token, device_name, device_guid}
    UI->>UI: Keep token in React memory

    Operator->>UI: Search/select customer and submit payment
    UI->>API: POST /api/payments + bearer token + x-device-guid
    API->>Auth: Check token, GUID match, and active device
    Auth->>DB: Check authorised_devices
    DB-->>Auth: Active status
    Auth-->>API: Allow request
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    API->>DB: SELECT pending_balance ... FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>API: Current balance
    API->>DB: INSERT debt_payments
    API->>DB: UPDATE customers.pending_balance
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 201 payment + previous/updated balance + X-Access-Token
    UI->>UI: Replace in-memory JWT
    UI-->>Operator: Show receipt and updated balance

    opt A database operation fails
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>UI: 500 {error}
        UI-->>Operator: Show payment error
    end
